{"recordId":"general_兀良哈台_2133746318","name":"兀良哈台","type":"general","dynasty":"元朝","title":"南疆拓主","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"兀良哈台","pageId":1277744,"revisionId":94680990,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-10-01T04:34:39Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%80%E8%89%AF%E5%93%88%E5%8F%B0","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94680990","wikidataId":"Q1069320","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"兀良合台","url":"http://www.confucianism.com.cn/html/lishi/1462683.html","type":"citation-template","template":"Cite web","author":"","publisher":"","date":"","isbn":"","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"《中国民族史人物辞典》","url":null,"type":"citation-template","template":"cite book","author":"","publisher":"中国社会科学出版社","date":"1990年","isbn":"","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"中国民族史人物辞典","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[{"title":"元史/卷121#兀良合臺","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%85%83%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7121#%E5%85%80%E8%89%AF%E5%90%88%E8%87%BA","origin":"sister-template","retrieved":false}],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:37:05.327Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:yuanshi","source:songshi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-b8cffe3e8c809b40","query":"兀良哈台","count":3,"offset":8026,"excerpt":"兵取處州路。戊申，陳友諒兵陷杉關。\n\n十二月戊辰，太白犯壘壁陣。是月，知樞密院事兀良哈台領太不花軍，其所部方脫脫與弟方伯帖木兒時保遼州，兀良哈台同唐琰、高脫因等屯孟州，與察罕帖木兒部將八不沙等交兵。已而兀良哈台獨引達達軍還京師，方脫脫等乃從孛羅帖木","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-8e3a2fb0e77fb550","query":"兀良哈台","count":4,"offset":2281,"excerpt":"木答兒定河南，累有戰功。\n\n憲宗之伐宋也，世祖以皇弟受命攻鄂。大駕征西川，遣元帥兀良哈台自交趾擣宋，與諸軍合。歲己未，皇弟駐兵鄂渚，聞兀良哈台由廣西至長沙，遣鐵邁赤將練卒千人、鐵騎三千迎兀良哈台于岳州。兀良哈台得援，抵江夏，北涉黃州，鐵邁赤與有力焉","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-88854e0d5f5d0324","query":"兀良哈台","count":2,"offset":8624,"excerpt":"「臣長子死，不能為國效力，今以次子捏古來獻之陛下，願用之。」\n\n捏古來至，帝命從兀良哈台征哈剌章，有功，兀良哈台賞以白金名馬。從伐宋，中流矢而死。\n\n子忽兒都答，充管軍百戶。世祖命從不羅那顏使哈兒馬某之地，以疾卒。\n\n子忽都帖木兒，武宗潛邸時從征海","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-d25630b4377707f7","query":"兀良哈台","count":1,"offset":6230,"excerpt":"漢，自是兵端大啟。\n\n　　開慶初，憲宗皇帝自將征蜀，世祖皇帝時以皇弟攻鄂州，元帥兀良哈台由雲南入交阯，自邕州蹂廣西，破湖南，傳檄數宋背盟之罪。理宗大懼，乃以趙葵軍信州，禦廣兵；以似道軍漢陽，援鄂，即軍中拜右丞相。十月，鄂東南陬破，宋人再築，再破之，","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":4,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:yuanshi-b8cffe3e8c809b40","bookId":"book:yuanshi","requestedTitle":"元史/卷045","title":"元史/卷045","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%85%83%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7045","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1814447","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%85%83%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7045?action=history","revisionId":1814447,"revisionTimestamp":"2020-05-27T12:48:15Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:57:10.265Z","sha256":"ed1acaaeede1b18585835125187c0c4e468292aa48d9f7d253b6400e99678a81","textSha256":"4c48281dd00479a664d7fc20290cd85d154ed36864b56ba41532ff0d159ba01a","expandedWikitextSha256":"ed1acaaeede1b18585835125187c0c4e468292aa48d9f7d253b6400e99678a81","characters":10013,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/yuanshi.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:41.716Z","upstreamTextQuality":50,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed"